hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1034","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abu Hathma (raziyallahu anhu) apni qaum ke baray logon se bayan kartay hain ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisa (raziyallahu anhuma) donon kisi takleef ki wajah se Khaibar gaye. Muhayyisa (raziyallahu anhu) ne aa kar bataya ke Abdullah bin Sahl (raziyallahu anhu) maaray gaye aur un ki naash chashma ya kunwan mein phaink di gayi hai. Wo Yahud ke paas aaye aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam tum ne un ko qatl kiya hai. Yahudiyon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam ham ne unhein qatl nahi kiya. Phir wo apni qaum ke paas aaye aur un se bayan kiya. Phir Muhayyisa aur un ka bhai Huwayyisa jo un se bara tha aur Abdur Rahman bin Sahl teenon, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas, aaye. Muhayyisa ne baat karna chaha ke wohi, Abdullah bin Sahl (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath, Khaibar ko gaye thay, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Muhayyisa se farmaya ke baray ki barayi kar aur baray ko kehnay de. Phir Huwayyisa (raziyallahu anhu) ne baat ki aur phir Muhayyisa ne baat ki. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Muhayyisa (raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya ke ya to Yahud tumharay saathi ki deet dein ya jang karein. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Yahud ko us baaray mein likha to unhon ne jawab mein likha ke Allah ki qasam ham ne us ko qatl nahi kiya. Tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Huwayyisa, Muhayyisa aur Abdur Rahman (raziyallahu anhuma) se farmaya ke tum qasam khatay ho ke apne saathi ka qisaas lo? Unhon ne kaha nahi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke phir Yahud tumharay liye qasam khayein ge. Unhon ne kaha ke wo Musalman nahi, un ki, qasam ka kya aitbaar. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki deet apne paas se di aur sau oont un ke paas bhejay yahan tak ke un ke ghar mein pahuncha diye gaye. Sahl (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke un mein se aik surkh oontni ne mujhe laat maar di thi. (Muslim). (Faqeer se murad qareeb kunwan hai; ya to deet dein ya hum par jang musallat ho jaye.)"
"1035","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar kehtay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab mein se aik Ansaari sahabi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne qasaama ko usi taur par baaqi rakha jaisay jahiliyat ke zamana mein thi. (Muslim: 5/101)"
